### =====================================================
### PRODUCT CRUD
### =====================================================


### Create Product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rice 5kg",
  "price": 650,
  "reorderThreshold": 10,
  "reorderQuantity": 50
}


### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products


### Get Product By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1


### Update Product
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Rice 5kg Premium",
  "price": 700,
  "reorderThreshold": 15,
  "reorderQuantity": 60
}


### Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/1



### =====================================================
### STOCK MOVEMENT
### =====================================================


### Create Stock IN - Purchase
POST http://localhost:8080/api/stock-movements/product/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 50,
  "movementType": "IN",
  "reason": "PURCHASE"
}


### Create Stock OUT - Sale
POST http://localhost:8080/api/stock-movements/product/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 45,
  "movementType": "OUT",
  "reason": "SALE"
}


### Get All Stock Movements
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stock-movements


### Get Stock Movements By Product
GET http://localhost:8080/api/stock-movements/product/1

